From 35fe159d16aaadfd17157543344596d5ae17b38d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joseph Kogut <joseph.kogut@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Jul 2026 12:39:48 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] rutabaga: use virgl_renderer_resource_map_fixed

virglrenderer MR 1374 landed the fixed-address resource mapping
operation as virgl_renderer_resource_map_fixed with a two-argument ABI.
Upstream virglrenderer 1.3.0 therefore no longer exports the provisional
virgl_renderer_resource_map2 symbol, causing libkrun builds to fail when
VIRGL_RESOURCE_MAP2 is enabled.

Replace the provisional binding and call signature so the fixed-mapping
path builds against upstream virglrenderer 1.3.0.

Assisted-by: Codex: gpt-5.6-sol
Signed-off-by: Joseph Kogut <joseph.kogut@gmail.com>
