From 8d459adf81ec75db7aeb28663e7c80280e4e29a7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joseph Kogut <joseph.kogut@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Jul 2026 12:40:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] gpu: detect fixed resource mapping

Resolve virgl_renderer_resource_map_fixed at runtime in the virtio-gpu
device layer and use fixed-address blob mappings automatically when the
loaded virglrenderer provides it. Keep the legacy fd path as the
fallback, with direct mmap handling for SHM and dma-buf resources.

Remove the libkrun-specific placed-mapping API, provisional binding, and
Cargo feature from the vendored Rutabaga copy. Retain
KRUN_FEATURE_VIRGL_RESOURCE_MAP_FIXED at ID 10 and keep
KRUN_FEATURE_VIRGL_RESOURCE_MAP2 as a compatibility alias.

Signed-off-by: Joseph Kogut <joseph.kogut@gmail.com>
Assisted-by: Codex: gpt-5.6-sol
